flowchart TD
    A[User Types URL/Clicks Link] --> B{User Logged In?}
    
    B -->|No| C[Landing Page]
    B -->|Yes| D[Main Chat Interface]
    
    C --> E[Browse Features & Content]
    E --> F[Click Sign Up Button]
    F --> G[Enter Credentials & Sign Up]
    G --> H[Account Created Successfully]
    H --> D
    
    D --> I[Chat with Virtual Assistant]
    I --> J[Receive Response from Assistant]
    J --> K{Response Contains External Links?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Click External Link]
    K -->|No| AA[Continue Using Chat Interface]
    L --> N[Navigate to External Website]
    AA --> I
    
    D --> O[Click Profile Picture Icon]
    O --> P[Account Menu Opens]
    P --> Q{User Selection?}
    
    Q -->|Sign Out| R[Sign Out of Account]
    Q -->|Settings| S[Settings Page]
    Q -->|Admin Dashboard| T{User is Admin?}
    
    R --> C
    
    S --> U[Change Settings]
    U --> V[Click Done Button]
    V --> D
    
    T